  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats pill path as a named cultivation path with its own dao marks, pills, and killer moves, not as ordinary medicine craft.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, Fang Yuan sees round, smooth dao marks that seem to carry a light grass and food scent, and he guesses they are the rumored pill path dao mark. He also notes that immortal materials made from gathered pill path dao marks would be reference for creating the corresponding path.",
      "chapters": [
        1865
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After raising most paths from dream realms, Fang Yuan still has pill path blank, and the narration places such paths’ production after Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s era.",
      "chapters": [
        2150
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ruan Dan is an immemorial green jade crane nurtured by Immortal Crane Sect. It created pill path and resides in Heavenly Court to cultivate in ordinary times.",
      "chapters": [
        1712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ruan-dan-creates-the-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ruan_dan",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Ruan Dan aids Shabi Ninety-five, it spat out a bright red pill that self-detonates against Rising Cloud City. Even though pill path was not specialized in offense, it was still a new path that Rising Cloud City could not guard against. Ruan Dan also uses the killer move life-saving recovery pill after being beaten unconscious.",
      "chapters": [
        2179
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "offense-and-recovery",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shabi_ninety_five",
        "house_rising_cloud_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Crazed Demon Cave battle, Fang Yuan counts Ruan Dan’s pill path among Heavenly Court methods he now understands. He also names pill path with dream path among the rare tribulation kinds that can still threaten him, while ordinary grand tribulations and myriad tribulations are otherwise no threat.",
      "chapters": [
        2215
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "offense-and-recovery",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
